PART (c): independent re-verification, from PRIMARY definitions, of
          S_n'(gamma) = 1 + S_n(gamma)
==============================================================================
A_k(n,g) := sum_{mm=0}^{k} C(k,mm) g^mm (1-g)^(k-mm) * P_{k,mm},
P_{k,mm} := prod_{i=1}^{mm} (1 - (k-i)/n)   [empty product = 1 for mm=0]
S_n(g) := sum_{k=1}^{n} A_k(n,g)

term_m(n,g) := (g/n)^m * m! * T(n,m),
T(n,m) := sum_{j=0}^{n-m} C(j+m,m)*C(n-j,m)*(1-g)^j
S_n'(g) := sum_{m=0}^{n} term_m(n,g)

